ers with intense red colors can be brewed. The malt was designed for a P12 beer. For stronger beers, due to the higher original wort content, some BEST Pilsener malt should be added proportionally to the bulk to get back into the red range.", "amount": 3.5, "hidden": false, "origin": "Germany", "usedIn": "", "protein": 11.7, "moisture": 3.7, "supplier": "BESTMALZ", "inventory": null, "potential": 1.035, "userNotes": "", "friability": null, "maxInBatch": 100, "percentage": 70, "substitutes": "", "ibuPerAmount": 0, "costPerAmount": null, "grainCategory": "Crystal/Caramel", "bestBeforeDate": null, "coarseFineDiff": 1.5, "diastaticPower": 120, "notFermentable": false, "manufacturingDate": null, "potentialPercentage": 75}, {"_id": "default-8VJOq0moByoYBW5sopxUY4xtdkgpqt", "fan": null, "_rev": "44XTbgkvcqbN0g3UVZnrEB55mMzBHf", "acid": 0, "cgdb": null, "fgdb": null, "name": "Extra Pale Premium Pilsner", "type": "Grain", "color": 1.522843, "notes": "Excellent choice for continental lager styles, as well as ales, looking to achieve a pale straw-gold colour", "amount": 1, "hidden": false, "origin": "Germany", "usedIn": "", "protein": 10.5, "_created": {"_seconds": 1701023493, "_nanoseconds": 636000000}, "_version": "2.9.2", "lovibond": 1.7, "moisture": 5, "supplier": "Weyermann", "inventory": 18.5, "potential": 1.038, "userNotes": "", "_timestamp": {"_seconds": 1701023493, "_nanoseconds": 636000000}, "friability": 80, "maxInBatch": 100, "percentage": 20, "substitutes": "Pilsner Liquid Extract", "ibuPerAmount": 0, "_timestamp_ms": 1701023493636, "costPerAmount": null, "grainCategory": "Base (Pilsner)", "bestBeforeDate": null, "coarseFineDiff": null, "diastaticPower": null, "notFermentable": false, "manufacturingDate": null, "potentialPercentage": 82}, {"_id": "default-dcfc89d", "fan": null, "_rev": "wVBJ58RdIGtdnVnlGRrBPWCzTN2miJ", "acid": null, "cgdb": null, "fgdb": null, "name": "Chateau Cara Ruby", "type": "Grain", "color": 25.38, "notes": "", "amount": 0.5, "hidden": false